},{"k":"p","t":"If your game kit includes a cardboard video display bezel, make sure it can fit the 33-inch video display used in the Showcase cabinet. Cut the hole and out-"},{"k":"p","t":"1-6 side edges as required. Then find the game instructions label in the kit, and adhere that label to the control panel, under the Lexan cover."},{"k":"p","t":"Installing the Attraction Assembly"},{"k":"p","t":"Find the game attraction film in your kit (the attraction shield of the Showcase 33 cabinet should be reused), Using the existing shield as a template, cut the film to size, if necessary. Install them in the cabinet attraction assembly."},{"k":"p","t":"1-6"}],"18":[{"k":"p","t":"Parts Illustrations Showcase 33 Service Manual"},{"k":"p","t":"Figure 3-1 Cabinet Assembly A052875-01 B"},{"k":"p","t":"Parts List"},{"k":"tr","t":"Item No.   Part No.   Quantity   Description"},{"k":"tr","t":"1   A051839-01   1   ASSEMBLY, ON/OFF SWITCH MODULE"},{"k":"tr","t":"3   A052910-01   1   ASSEMBLY, HARNESS, MAIN"},{"k":"tr","t":"4   A052911-01   1   ASSEMBLY, HARNESS, SECONDARY POWER"},{"k":"tr","t":"5   A052913-01   2   ASSEMBLY, HARNESS, SPEAKER"},{"k":"tr","t":"6   A052914-01   1   ASSEMBLY, HARNESS, PRIMARY POWER"},{"k":"tr","t":"7   A052920-01   1   ASSEMBLY, POWER SUPPLY"},{"k":"tr","t":"10   038086-01   2   LABEL, SHOCK WARNING"},{"k":"tr","t":"11   038158-01   1   LABELS, PRODUCT I.D."},{"k":"tr","t":"12   039450-01   1   LABEL, FCC COMPLIANCE"},{"k":"tr","t":"13   049514-02   1   LABEL, UL, LISTING MARK"},{"k":"tr","t":"14   051079-01   1   LABEL, FUSE, 3A, SLOW BLOW"},{"k":"tr","t":"15   052813-01   2   RETAINER, PLEX"},{"k":"tr","t":"16   052814-01   2   GRILLE, SPEAKER"},{"k":"tr","t":"17   052816-01   2   BRACKETS, MONITOR MOUNTING"},{"k":"tr","t":"18   052822-01   1   GRILLE, SPEAKER"},{"k":"tr","t":"19   052823-01   1   COVER, POWER SUPPLY"},{"k":"tr","t":"20   052824-01   1   SHIELD, FRONT"},{"k":"tr","t":"21   052828-01   1   BEZEL, MASKING"},{"k":"tr","t":"22   052829-0